Hi Vanessa,
I made some edits to the functions and it may not give you the output you need. Run all three attached functions and then the code below:

1. cameraOperation has a new argument, sessionCol. Specify it and the function will create a camera operation matrix where rownames consist of station and session names

camop_session3 <- cameraOperation(CTtable      = camtraps_cam_S,
                                  stationCol   = "Station",
                                  sessionCol   = "Sessioncol",    # new argument
                                  cameraCol    = "Camera",

                                  setupCol     = "Setup_date",
                                  retrievalCol = "Retrieval_date",
                                  writecsv     = FALSE,
                                  dateFormat   = "%Y-%m-%d",
                                  allCamsOn    = FALSE,

                                  byCamera     = FALSE,            # changed this

                                  camerasIndependent = TRUE,
                                  hasProblems  = TRUE
)

> str(camop_session3)
